{
 "_doc": {
  "zh": "soma 骨架的关节定义。tools/rig/joints.ts 按每条定义的 recipe（做法）去拟合所列骨的关节面，得到一个 Joint。sides: true 会展开 {s}=L|R、{Side}=Left|Right、{side}=left|right、{zh}=左|右；for 再展开其它变量。bones 是随该关节刚性运动的部件（按英文名）。tail 是该关节所带动节段的远端（另一个关节的中心，或 recipe 算出的解剖标志）。frame.keep：axis = 保持拟合/指定的轴 0 不变，长轴取与它垂直的方向（铰链）；long = 以节段长轴为轴 2，轴 0 取与它垂直的方向。自由度的 sign: [参考点, 方向] 规定轴的指向：绕该轴作小的正向转动时，参考点（tail | front | up | down | lateral，相对关节中心）必须朝所给的身体方向移动。rom 是 rom.json 里的键。rest 说明如何在本模型上测出该自由度在静止姿势下的解剖学角度，以便把活动范围换算成相对静止姿势的角度。branch 标出所属的指（趾），仅供参考。",
  "en": "Joint definitions of the soma rig. tools/rig/joints.ts turns each entry into a Joint by fitting the articular surfaces of the named bones as its `recipe` says. `sides: true` expands {s}=L|R, {Side}=Left|Right, {side}=left|right, {zh}=左|右; `for` expands further variables. `bones` are the parts (by English name) that move rigidly with the joint. `tail` is the distal end of the segment the joint moves (another joint's centre, or a landmark computed by the recipe). `frame.keep`: 'axis' keeps the fitted or declared axis 0 exact and makes the long axis perpendicular to it (hinges); 'long' keeps the segment axis as axis 2 and squares axis 0 to it. A dof's `sign: [ref, direction]` fixes the sense of its axis: a small positive rotation must move the reference point (tail | front | up | down | lateral, relative to the centre) in that body direction. `rom` is a key of rom.json. `rest` says how the dof's anatomical angle in the rest pose is measured on this body, so that ranges can be expressed about the model's own rest pose. `branch` names the digit a joint belongs to, for information only."
 },
